			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150050101,
					"content": "The defeated Koholasaurs scatter and run away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150050102,
					"content": "Judging from your clothes, you must be scholars from Sumeru, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050103,
					"content": "Yes, I'm Karya, and this is my senior, Viramdra. Thank you so much for saving us. That was a little too close...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050104,
					"content": "#Don't mention it! Handling these sort of things is practically second nature to us by now. Paimon is Paimon, and this is {NICKNAME}!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050105,
					"content": "*sigh* Still, it seems that all the Koholasaurs just ran off... We need to capture at least one alive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050106,
					"content": "Huh? Capture one alive?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050107,
					"content": "Correct. Say, I can see you are very skilled at dealing with them. Do you think you could use me as live bait to help us capture one? I will pay you for the effort!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050108,
					"content": "Um, well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050109,
					"content": "Apologies. Viramdra has been hyper-focused on his research, so please, don't be too hard on him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050110,
					"content": "Oh, no worries! But why did you approach a whole group of wild Koholasaurs? And what's this talk about \"capturing them\"?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050111,
					"content": "Don't tell me you want to get a picture with them, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150050112,
					"content": "Paimon's pretty sure that's not what they're trying to do!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050113,
					"content": "I'm sure we must look very silly... The fact of the matter is that we're searching for a mysterious island from a certain legend. It's said that a very important clue about the island can be found on Koholasaurs, so...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050114,
					"content": "Approaching them without the help of a guide from the People of the Springs was certainly an unwise choice on our part.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050115,
					"content": "A mysterious island?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050116,
					"content": "Yes. There's a legend from the People of the Springs that mentions a mysterious island, and Viramdra believes the key to his research can be found there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050117,
					"content": "Ahem... Are you certain you two won't consider my proposal to capture one?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050118,
					"content": "Some proposal... There's no way we'd be willing to use a person as live bait!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050119,
					"content": "Then I suppose discussing it any further will just be a waste of time. I must come up with another solution...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050120,
					"content": "Ahem... Viramdra!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050121,
					"content": "Oh, alright... You did rescue Karya and I just now, and I suppose I should express some gratitude. Thank you very much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050122,
					"content": "A little awkward, but Paimon'll take it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050123,
					"content": "We should move on, Karya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050124,
					"content": "Yes, thank you again. My apologies... Viramdra really doesn't have the best people skills.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050125,
					"content": "That's alright, bye now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050126,
					"content": "You really don't see a pair of adventurers like those two every day!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050127,
					"content": "But anyway, Paimon's really curious about that mysterious island that lady just mentioned!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050128,
					"content": "Do you wanna find the island too, Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150050129,
					"content": "Yeah! Who knows, there might be treasure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050130,
					"content": "After all the amazing places we've explored during our adventures, finding some mysterious island should be a walk in the park for us!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050131,
					"content": "But we don't have any info about this island.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050132
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150050132,
					"content": "Ah, you're right... The lady mentioned that the mysterious island is related to a legend of the People of the Springs... So maybe we can start by asking some of them about it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050133,
					"content": "Time's ticking. Let's get started on our next adventure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050134,
					"content": "But the real question is... who should we ask?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150050135,
					"content": "Can we just talk to the chief?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150050136
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150050136,
					"content": "Hmm... that's an idea. If anyone, the chief of the tribe should know the details!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
